  "text": "Giant Mole (Hard Mode)\n\n​\nIntroduction\nThis is an advanced guide which assumes a strong underlying knowledge of all mechanics and information presented in #giant-mole-basic.\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Melee \n\n​\nRotations\n⬥ Abyssal Scourge  is required for this method to work\n​\n →  or wait for 60% adren →  (giant mole will now dig twice, watch for her 2nd dig location)\n​\n →  to where the giant mole is positioned\n​\n →  mini moles inside tunnels on the way to giant mole\n​\n → giant mole will now dig back to starting chamber\n​\n →  →  → \n​\nNotes:\n⬥ *You may find that if the giant mole digs to the northwestern chamber first, she may not go back to the starting chamber after your \n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• This is due to the damage reduction mechanic.*\n⬥ If this happens you will need to follow her to a 2nd chamber and  which will guarantee her to dig to the starting chamber.\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ Example kill - Tz Matt xD \n\n\n​\n      \n    ",
